# 3. Project Design Phase

**Project Name:** FitBuddy – AI Fitness Plan Generator using Gemini Models

## System Architecture

* **Frontend:** HTML, CSS and Jinja2
* **Backend:** FastAPI
* **AI Layer:** Google Gemini Pro and Gemini Flash
* **Database:** SQLite with SQLAlchemy

## Main Modules

* User Input Module
* Workout Plan Generator
* Nutrition Tip Generator
* Feedback Update Module
* Database Module
* Admin View

## Application Flow

User Input
↓
FastAPI Backend
↓
Gemini AI
↓
Workout Plan & Nutrition Tip
↓
SQLite Database
↓
Result Display

## Main Pages

* `index.html` – User input form
* `result.html` – Workout plan and feedback
* `all_users.html` – Admin view
